  "id": 795,
  "title": "建设数字化校园，实现校园节能减碳",
  "date": "2024-09-19",
  "summary": "学校可以逐步建设数字化校园，有效实现节能减碳目标，为未来可持续发展贡献自己的力量。这不仅有助于降低校园运行成本，提升管理效率，还能为师生创造更加舒适、健康的学习生活环境。",
  "abstract": null,
  "category": "公司动态",
  "href": "/information/detail-795.html",
  "image": "https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-9-19/2024919111326455.png",
  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">数字化校园的建设是一个系统性工程，需要综合考虑校园各方面的需求与资源利用。以下是古河云科技一些关键步骤和策略，帮助学校实现节能减碳目标：</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\"><img src=\"https://qiniu.guhecloud.com/legacy-site/Uploadfiles/Picture/2024-9-19/2024919111326455.png\" title=\"376\" alt=\"376\" /><br /><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">1. 能源管理系统</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">部署智能能源监测系统：安装能源监测设备，实时监测校园各处的能源消耗，包括电力、水资源等。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">数据分析与优化：通过数据分析，识别能源浪费和潜在节能机会，并制定相应的节能优化计划。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">2. 绿色建筑与设施</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">可再生能源利用：考虑在校园内采用太阳能光伏、风能等可再生能源设施，减少对传统能源的依赖。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">节能照明系统：更新校园照明系统为</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">LED灯具，采用光感控制等智能技术，降低能耗。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">3. 智能化运维与管理</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">智能楼宇管理系统（</span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">IBMS）：引入IBMS系统，实现对校园设施的集中监控和智能控制，优化能源利用和管理效率。</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">智能化设备运维：利用物联网技术进行设备远程监控和维护，提高设备利用率，延长寿命。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">4. 教育宣传与培训</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">节能意识培训：开展师生节能减碳意识教育，鼓励大家共同参与节能行动，推动整个校园形成节约资源、保护环境的氛围。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">信息公示平台：建立数字化信息公示平台，定期发布校园节能减碳成果和倡议，增强全校师生的参与感。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">5. 数据监测与评估</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">持续监测与评估：建立完善的数据监测体系，定期对节能减碳效果进行评估和反馈，及时调整和改进相关措施。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">6. 合作与共享</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">校园合作平台：积极与政府、企业、社区等建立合作关系，共同探讨并实施校园节能减碳项目，促进资源共享和协同发展。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:0;font-size:14px\">通过以上措施的综合实施，学校可以逐步建设<a href=\"https://www.guhecloud.com/\" target=\"_self\"><strong>数字化</strong></a>校园，有效实现节能减碳目标，为未来可持续发展贡献自己的力量。这不仅有助于降低校园运行成本，提升管理效率，还能为师生创造更加舒适、健康的学习生活环境。</span></p>",
